# Click "Send Request" (VS Code REST Client extension) on each block, top to bottom.
@base = http://localhost:3000

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### 1. Create a cache with capacity 2
POST {{base}}/caches
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "users", "capacity": 2 }

### 2. Put a
PUT {{base}}/caches/users/keys/a
Content-Type: application/json

{ "value": { "id": 1, "name": "Asha" } }

### 3. Put b
PUT {{base}}/caches/users/keys/b
Content-Type: application/json

{ "value": "two" }

### 4. Get a  -> a becomes most recently used
GET {{base}}/caches/users/keys/a

### 5. Put c  -> evictedKey: "b"
PUT {{base}}/caches/users/keys/c
Content-Type: application/json

{ "value": 3 }

### 6. Get b  -> 404
GET {{base}}/caches/users/keys/b

### 7. Keys, most recent first  -> [c, a]
GET {{base}}/caches/users/keys

### 8. Stats
GET {{base}}/caches/users/stats

### 9. Key with a 5 s TTL (GET it again after 5 s -> 404)
PUT {{base}}/caches/users/keys/otp
Content-Type: application/json

{ "value": "123456", "ttlMs": 5000 }

### 10. Validation error (400): capacity 0, unknown field
POST {{base}}/caches
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "bad name!", "capacity": 0, "foo": 1 }

### 11. Duplicate (409)
POST {{base}}/caches
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "users", "capacity": 2 }

### 12. Delete a key / delete the cache
DELETE {{base}}/caches/users/keys/a

###
DELETE {{base}}/caches/users
